    { id=536, name="Yor", order=3, desc="A \"gift\" from Illidan Stormrage to accompany Nexus-Prince Shaffar, Yor is a void hound of unlimited savagery and power.  The prince's advisors warned him that Illidan's demonic gift was most likely a ruse set to betray Shaffar once he had met his goals. The prince fed those advisors to Yor... but has since kept the hound in a stasis chamber, just in case.", uiMapID=272, x=0.3565570116, y=0.60860699415, rootSection=5194,
