          body="Ambassador Hellmaw sprays corrosive acid on all players in front of him, inflicting Nature damage every $33551t1 seconds and reducing their armor by $33551s2 for $33551d." },
      },
    },
    { id=545, name="Blackheart the Inciter", order=2, desc="When the orcish Horde first invaded Azeroth through the Dark Portal, two Shadow Council members instead turned their attentions to the ancient draenei burial grounds of Auchindoun. The unquiet spirits in the area proved to be excellent subjects for the warlock Blackheart to perfect his mind control abilities.", uiMapID=260, x=0.26776000857, y=0.70491802692, rootSection=5263,
      creatures = { {display=18058, file=607555, name="Blackheart the Inciter"} },
      loot = {
        {id=29434,pct=100.0,diff="h"}, {id=30808,pct=100.0}, {id=27468,pct=16.7}, {id=27890,pct=16.7}, {id=27891,pct=16.7}, {id=27892,pct=16.7}, {id=27893,pct=16.7}, {id=28134,pct=16.7}, {id=25728,pct=5.0}, {id=30559,pct=5.0,diff="h"},
