          body="Murmur touches a player, causing the air around them to pulse with sonic energy for $38794d, pulling all other players towards them. When Murmur's Touch fades, a shockwave of energy inflicts $33686s2 Nature damage and silences all players within $33686A1 yards of the player that was touched for $33686d.", diff="h" },
        { id=5276, title="Sonic Shock", parent=0, child=0, sib=5277, order=5, spell=0, icon=135730, flags=0, cdisp=0,
