          body="Grand Warlock Nethekurse creates a fissure of Consumption under a player, inflicting $30498s1 Shadow damage every $30498t1 sec while they are inside of the fissure." },
        { id=5500, title="Dark Spin", parent=0, child=0, sib=0, order=5, spell=0, icon=136202, flags=38, cdisp=0,
          body="When Grand Warlock Nethekurse reaches 25% health, he enters a Dark Spin of shadow and steel. Dark Spin inflicts Physical damage to all players within $30508A1 yards and hurls bolts of dark magic every $30502t1 sec that inflict $30505s1 Shadow damage to a random player." },
      },
    },
    { id=728, name="Blood Guard Porung", order=2, desc="During the bloody siege of Shattrath, Porung stormed an enclave of draenei paladins who had barricaded themselves within a corner of the city. He single-handedly slaughtered the defenders, but suffered a grave injury that left him incapable of following the Horde when it later stormed Azeroth. Now recovered, Porung serves Warchief Kargath Bladefist in Hellfire Citadel, hoping to make up for the glorious battles he has missed and write his name in orcish history with the blood of his enemies.", uiMapID=246, x=0.29684600234, y=0.14656800032, rootSection=6662,
      creatures = { {display=17725, file=607556, name="Blood Guard Porung"} },
      loot = {
        {id=29434,pct=100.0,diff="h"}, {id=30705,pct=20.0,diff="h"}, {id=30707,pct=20.0,diff="h"}, {id=30708,pct=20.0,diff="h"}, {id=30709,pct=20.0,diff="h"}, {id=30710,pct=20.0,diff="h"}, {id=30546,pct=5.0,diff="h"}, {id=30547,pct=5.0,diff="h"}, {id=30548,pct=5.0,diff="h"},
